"""Polls the Claude account's usage numbers and writes usage.json for the plasmoid.

Reads them off the anthropic-ratelimit-unified-* headers of a tiny /v1/messages
ping, the same numbers Claude Code shows, with /api/oauth/usage kept only as a
fallback -- see DEFAULT_INTERVAL.

Reads the OAuth token Claude Code stores in ~/.claude/.credentials.json, and
writes a refreshed token back when it expires. See the Security section of the
README: this daemon shares a credential file it does not own.
"""
