    # fractional reset epoch -- "1759...0.0", which servers do send -- threw away
    # a utilization that had already parsed, and since a one-window dict is
    # still truthy, collect saw a reply and never fell back to the endpoint. The
    # five-hour bar simply vanished from the panel with nothing said.
    fractional = usage_from_headers({
        "anthropic-ratelimit-unified-5h-utilization": "0.5",
        "anthropic-ratelimit-unified-5h-reset": "1759000000.5",
